{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53820","headline":"西岩山 · 白居易","name":"西岩山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千古仙居物象饶，道成丹熟昼昇霄。\n岩前宝磬转松韵，洞口灵池应海潮。\n崖折百花迟日晚，鹤归清夜唳声遥。\n登临渐到希夷境，手拂行云度石桥。\n（同前卷二七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}